[?2004l[?2004h> - GET of the visible UnPost action makes the entry unposted, retaining both balanced lines. A raw HTTP/1.0 GET to its Post action returned 400; official detail still shows it unposted.
[?2004l[?2004h> - Initial replay proof at /testbed/proof.json captures CSRF, URLs, and session dynamically. Next: test raw HTTP/1.1 posting baseline, then a bounded malformed-connection variant and official readback.
